  "body": "## Summary\n\nImplements OAuth 2.0 with PKCE as described in the auth architecture doc.\n\n### Changes\n- `src/auth/oauth.ts` — OAuth client with PKCE code challenge\n- `src/auth/token.ts` — Token exchange, refresh, and revocation\n- `src/auth/middleware.ts` — Express middleware for route protection\n- `src/auth/session.ts` — Secure session management with rotation\n- Tests for all new modules\n\n### Why PKCE?\nPrevents auth code interception in native/SPA clients without needing a client secret.\n\nCloses #4400",
